Subject: [PATCH] feat(verify): prove execution of captured mask selection

Add an inactive tensor/SCF interpretation, actual-program cut checking and bounded execution proofs. Preserve the f32 repair policy through the extended evaluator and compose suffixes under the same interpretation.

Qualify the captured SmolVLA cut and independent cases with authoritative MLIR verification, native execution, pinned PyTorch and refusal tests. Keep protected definitions, locks and active pipeline interpretation unchanged.
